+ * Time of day from the PM660 RTC (SID 0, peripheral 0x60; DT
+ * qcom,pm660_rtc = qcom,pm8941-rtc, Linux rtc-pm8xxx): RTC_EN is bit 7 of
+ * 0x46, the seconds counter RDATA0..3 at 0x48..0x4b, least significant
